{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_ea42366d41284227ad89b3d8bf6cc667","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No nodeId was provided. Listing the top-level pages of the document. Call get_metadata again with one of the page ids below (or any node id underneath) to get the XML metadata for that subtree.\n\nTop-level pages of the document:\n- 0:1: 00 · Start Here 设计任务\n- 1:2: 01 · Foundations 视觉规范\n- 1:3: 02 · Components 组件库\n- 1:4: 04 · Media 素材库\n- 5:2: 03 · Workspace"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e2bed913-5c8b-48ac-b9f1-c427778f4691","uuid":"b73f499f-2c1a-4fdf-a67f-5ff9bbe8fe13","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:02:53.627Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"No nodeId was provided. Listing the top-level pages of the document. Call get_metadata again with one of the page ids below (or any node id underneath) to get the XML metadata for that subtree.\n\nTop-level pages of the document:\n- 0:1: 00 · Start Here 设计任务\n- 1:2: 01 · Foundations 视觉规范\n- 1:3: 02 · Components 组件库\n- 1:4: 04 · Media 素材库\n- 5:2: 03 · Workspace"}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"dedb229b-1454-40b6-ba15-ac0560f7cf54"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_ea42366d41284227ad89b3d8bf6cc667","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202611030702537921997888268d9d6hZi7N1XK","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_648f9e2a0ecd4ee69e9a9b27f0d0beee","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"async function inspectPages() {\n  const pages = figma.root.children;\n  const result = {};\n\n  for (const page of pages) {\n    await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\n    result[page.name] = {\n      id: page.id,\n      children: page.children.map(c => ({\n        id: c.id,\n        name: c.name,\n        type: c.type,\n        x: c.x,\n        y: c.y,\n        width: c.width,\n        height: c.height\n      }))\n    };\n  }\n\n  // Helper to dump text nodes from a page\n  async function getTextContents(pageName) {\n    const page = pages.find(p => p.name.includes(pageName));\n    if (!page) return [];\n    await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\n    const texts = page.findAll(n => n.type === 'TEXT');\n    return texts.map(t => ({ id: t.id, name: t.name, characters: t.characters, parent: t.parent.name }));\n  }\n\n  const startHereTexts = await getTextContents('00 · Start Here');\n  const foundationsTexts = await getTextContents('01 · Foundations');\n  \n  return {\n    pagesSummary: result,\n    startHereTexts,\n    foundationsTexts\n  };\n}\n\nreturn await inspectPages();\n","description":"Inspect top-level pages and extract text instructions from Start Here and Foundations pages","fileKey":"IAG5T5xfRayj74SLktrsW5"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10758,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e2bed913-5c8b-48ac-b9f1-c427778f4691","uuid":"404e7a59-adaf-45d9-b487-4d7fd5114e90","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:02:59.134Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_648f9e2a0ecd4ee69e9a9b27f0d0beee","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_648f9e2a0ecd4ee69e9a9b27f0d0beee","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"pagesSummary\":{\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\":{\"id\":\"0:1\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"1:5\",\"name\":\"Start Here · Brief\",\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"width\":1440,\"height\":6682}]},\"01 · Foundations 视觉规范\":{\"id\":\"1:2\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"2:2\",\"name\":\"Foundations\",\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"width\":1200,\"height\":909}]},\"02 · Components 组件库\":{\"id\":\"1:3\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"2:18\",\"name\":\"Components\",\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"width\":1200,\"height\":787}]},\"04 · Media 素材库\":{\"id\":\"1:4\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"3:52\",\"name\":\"Media\",\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"width\":1600,\"height\":3127}]},\"03 · Workspace\":{\"id\":\"5:2\",\"children\":[]}},\"startHereTexts\":[{\"id\":\"1:7\",\"name\":\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\",\"characters\":\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\",\"parent\":\"Header\"},{\"id\":\"1:8\",\"name\":\"Stylish — fashion & lifestyle shopping app\",\"characters\":\"Stylish — fashion & lifestyle shopping app\",\"parent\":\"Header\"},{\"id\":\"1:9\",\"name\":\"Design the complete Stylish mobile shopping app: a first-time shopper goes through onboarding, signs in, browses featured deals and trending products, opens a product, reviews the shopping bag, pays and manages the profile. Canvas 375 × 812, light mode only. Home, Product list, Product detail and Profile may scroll vertically. Currency: Indian rupee (₹). Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\",\"characters\":\"Design the complete Stylish mobile shopping app: a first-time shopper goes through onboarding, signs in, browses featured deals and trending products, opens a product, reviews the shopping bag, pays and manages the profile.\\nCanvas 375 × 812, light mode only. Home, Product list, Product detail and Profile may scroll vertically. Currency: Indian rupee (₹). Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\",\"parent\":\"Header\"},{\"id\":\"1:12\",\"name\":\"How to work\",\"characters\":\"How to work\",\"parent\":\"How to work\"},{\"id\":\"1:13\",\"name\":\"1. Build exactly the 15 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / disabled, sale and rating colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the main navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the logo, product photos, banners, payment logos and icons from 04 · Media. A product marked “no photo supplied” needs a consistent fallback of your choice. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\",\"characters\":\"1. Build exactly the 15 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links.\\n2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions.\\n3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / disabled, sale and rating colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently.\\n4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the main navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file.\\n5. Use the logo, product photos, banners, payment logos and icons from 04 · Media. A product marked “no photo supplied” needs a consistent fallback of your choice.\\n6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\",\"parent\":\"How to work\"},{\"id\":\"1:15\",\"name\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\",\"characters\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\",\"parent\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\"},{\"id\":\"1:16\",\"name\":\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\",\"characters\":\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\",\"parent\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\"},{\"id\":\"1:19\",\"name\":\"01_Splash\",\"characters\":\"01_Splash\",\"parent\":\"01_Splash\"},{\"id\":\"1:20\",\"name\":\"Goal: Recognise the brand while the app loads.\",\"characters\":\"Goal: Recognise the brand while the app loads.\",\"parent\":\"01_Splash\"},{\"id\":\"1:21\",\"name\":\"MUST INCLUDE\",\"characters\":\"MUST INCLUDE\",\"parent\":\"01_Splash\"},{\"id\":\"1:22\",\"name\":\"• Brand: Stylish logo\",\"characters\":\"• Brand: Stylish logo\",\"parent\":\"01_Splash\"},{\"id\":\"1:23\",\"name\":\"LINKS\",\"characters\":\"LINKS\",\"parent\":\"01_Splash\"},{\"id\":\"1:24\",\"name\":\"→ auto-advance → 02_Onboarding_Choose_Products\",\"characters\":\"→ auto-advance → 02_Onboarding_Choose_Products\",\"parent\":\"01_Splash\"},{\"id\":\"1:26\",\"name\":\"