6XXXXXXX · Account Holder’s Name Abhiraj Sisodiya · IFSC Code SBIN00428\",\"parent\":\"Profile\"},{\"id\":\"1:161\",\"name\":\"Onboarding & sign-in copy\",\"characters\":\"Onboarding & sign-in copy\",\"parent\":\"Onboarding & sign-in copy\"},{\"id\":\"1:162\",\"name\":\"02 “Choose Products” · 03 “Make Payment” · 04 “Get Your Order” (bodies as in the frame list) Sign in “Welcome Back!” · Sign up “Create an account” · Forgot “Forgot password?” Get Started “You want Authentic, here you go!” · “Find it here, buy it now!”\",\"characters\":\"02 “Choose Products” · 03 “Make Payment” · 04 “Get Your Order” (bodies as in the frame list)\\nSign in “Welcome Back!” · Sign up “Create an account” · Forgot “Forgot password?”\\nGet Started “You want Authentic, here you go!” · “Find it here, buy it now!”\",\"parent\":\"Onboarding & sign-in copy\"},{\"id\":\"1:164\",\"name\":\"What is fixed · what is yours\",\"characters\":\"What is fixed · what is yours\",\"parent\":\"What is fixed · what is yours\"},{\"id\":\"1:167\",\"name\":\"Fixed (given)\",\"characters\":\"Fixed (given)\",\"parent\":\"Fixed (given)\"},{\"id\":\"1:168\",\"name\":\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand primary color + Montserrat • Media: logo, product photos, banners, payment logos, icons, illustrated avatar • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\",\"characters\":\"• Frame list and exact names\\n• Must-include content per frame (what, not how)\\n• Navigation structure and links\\n• All data and copy\\n• Brand primary color + Montserrat\\n• Media: logo, product photos, banners, payment logos, icons, illustrated avatar\\n• Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\",\"parent\":\"Fixed (given)\"},{\"id\":\"1:170\",\"name\":\"Yours (designer decides)\",\"characters\":\"Yours (designer decides)\",\"parent\":\"Yours (designer decides)\"},{\"id\":\"1:171\",\"name\":\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, semantic, sale and rating colors • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: selected, pressed, disabled, focused, current slide / step • Headers, main navigation, product cards, dialogs and all business components • How prices, discounts and ratings are shown\",\"characters\":\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen\\n• All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, semantic, sale and rating colors\\n• Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation\\n• All states: selected, pressed, disabled, focused, current slide / step\\n• Headers, main navigation, product cards, dialogs and all business components\\n• How prices, discounts and ratings are shown\",\"parent\":\"Yours (designer decides)\"},{\"id\":\"1:173\",\"name\":\"How it is evaluated\",\"characters\":\"How it is evaluated\",\"parent\":\"How it is evaluated\"},{\"id\":\"1:174\",\"name\":\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\",\"characters\":\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\",\"parent\":\"How it is evaluated\"},{\"id\":\"1:175\",\"name\":\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data & copy accuracy 3. Flow & prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality & consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current tab, size, slide, step and payment method; empty forms)\",\"characters\":\"1. Checklist coverage per frame\\n2. Data & copy accuracy\\n3. Flow & prototype completeness\\n4. Information hierarchy\\n5. Visual quality & consistency of your own system\\n6. Component reuse\\n7. State design (current tab, size, slide, step and payment method; empty forms)\",\"parent\":\"How it is evaluated\"},{\"id\":\"1:176\",\"name\":\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 15 named frames, your components and the prototype.\",\"characters\":\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 15 named frames, your components and the prototype.\",\"parent\":\"How it is evaluated\"}],\"foundationsTexts\":[{\"id\":\"2:3\",\"name\":\"Foundations · Stylish\",\"characters\":\"Foundations · Stylish\",\"parent\":\"Foundations\"},{\"id\":\"2:4\",\"name\":\"Fixed: the brand primary color and the typeface below — they carry the Stylish identity. Everything else is yours to define and apply consistently: neutrals and grays, text colors, surfaces and backgrounds, semantic colors (success, error, warning, disabled), sale / discount and rating colors, type scale, weights per role, spacing, radii and elevation.\",\"characters\":\"Fixed: the brand primary color and the typeface below — they carry the Stylish identity. Everything else is yours to define and apply consistently: neutrals and grays, text colors, surfaces and backgrounds, semantic colors (success, error, warning, disabled), sale / discount and rating colors, type scale, weights per role, spacing, radii and elevation.\",\"parent\":\"Foundations\"},{\"id\":\"2:6\",\"name\":\"Brand color\",\"characters\":\"Brand color\",\"parent\":\"Brand color\"},{\"id\":\"2:9\",\"name\":\"Brand primary\",\"characters\":\"Brand primary\",\"parent\":\"Brand primary\"},{\"id\":\"2:10\",\"name\":\"#F83758\",\"characters\":\"#F83758\",\"parent\":\"Brand primary\"},{\"id\":\"2:11\",\"name\":\"The Stylish brand color. Where and how much to use it is your decision.\",\"characters\":\"The Stylish brand color. Where and how much to use it is your decision.\",\"parent\":\"Brand primary\"},{\"id\":\"2:13\",\"name\":\"Typeface\",\"characters\":\"Typeface\",\"parent\":\"Typeface\"},{\"id\":\"2:14\",\"name\":\"Montserrat\",\"characters\":\"Montserrat\",\"parent\":\"Typeface\"},{\"id\":\"2:15\",\"name\":\"Aa Bb Cc 0123456789 ₹1,500 50% Off\",\"characters\":\"Aa Bb Cc 0123456789  ₹1,500  50% Off\",\"parent\":\"Typeface\"},{\"id\":\"2:16\",\"name\":\"Use Montserrat for all UI text (Regular / Medium / SemiBold / Bold available). The Stylish logo is supplied as artwork in 04 · Media — do not retype it.\",\"characters\":\"Use Montserrat for all UI text (Regular / Medium / SemiBold / Bold available). The Stylish logo is supplied as artwork in 04 · Media — do not retype it.\",\"parent\":\"Typeface\"},{\"id\":\"2:17\",\"name\":\"Canvas: 375 × 812 (iPhone). Light mode only.\",\"characters\":\"Canvas: 375 × 812 (iPhone). Light mode only.\",\"parent\":\"Foundations\"}]}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e2bed913-5c8b-48ac-b9f1-c427778f4691","uuid":"a7a0f352-c50d-4c90-8f35-3e490b1c6fb2","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:03:02.682Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"pagesSummary\":{\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\":{\"id\":\"0:1\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"1:5\",\"name\":\"Start Here · Brief\",\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"width\":1440,\"height\":6682}]},\"01 · Foundations 视觉规范\":{\"id\":\"1:2\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"2:2\",\"name\":\"Foundations\",\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"width\":1200,\"height\":909}]},\"02 · Components 组件库\":{\"id\":\"1:3\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"2:18\",\"name\":\"Components\",\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"width\":1200,\"height\":787}]},\"04 · Media 素材库\":{\"id\":\"1:4\",\"children\":[{\"id\":\"3:52\",\"name\":\"Media\",\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"width\":1600,\"height\":3127}]},\"03 · Workspace\":{\"id\":\"5:2\",\"children\":[]}},\"startHereTexts\":[{\"id\":\"1:7\",\"name\":\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\",\"characters\":\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\",\"parent\":\"Header\"},{\"id\":\"1:8\",\"name\":\"Stylish — fashion & lifestyle shopping app\",\"characters\":\"Stylish — fashion & lifestyle shopping app\",\"parent\":\"Header\"},{\"id\":\"1:9\",\"name\":\"Design the complete Stylish mobile shopping app: a first-time shopper goes through onboarding, signs in, browses featured deals and trending products, opens a product, reviews the shopping bag, pays and manages the profile. Canvas 375 × 812, light mode only. Home, Product list, Product detail and Profile may scroll vertically. Currency: Indian rupee (₹). Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\",\"characters\":\"Design the complete Stylish mobile shopping app: a first-time shopper goes through onboarding, signs in, browses featured deals and trending products, opens a product, reviews the shopping bag, pays and manages the profile.\\nCanvas 375 × 812, light mode only. Home, Product list, Product detail and Profile may scroll vertically. Currency: Indian rupee (₹). Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\",\"parent\":\"Header\"},{\"id\":\"1:12\",\"name\":\"How to work\",\"characters\":\"How to work\",\"parent\":\"How to work\"},{\"id\":\"1:13\",\"name\":\"1. Build exactly the 15 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / disabled, sale and rating colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the main navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the logo, product photos, banners, payment logos and icons from 04 · Media. A product marked “no photo supplied” needs a consistent fallback of your choice. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\",\"characters\":\"1. Build exactly the 15 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links.\\n2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions.\\n3. The brand primary color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, surfaces, success / error / disabled, sale and rating colors), plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently.\\n4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the main navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file.\\n5. Use the logo, product photos, banners, payment logos and icons from 04 · Media. A product marked “no photo supplied” needs a consistent fallback of your choice.\\n6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\",\"parent\":\"How to work\"},{\"id\":\"1:15\",\"name\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\",\"characters\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\",\"parent\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\"},{\"id\":\"1:16\",\"name\":\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\",\"characters\":\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\",\"parent\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\"},{\"id\":\"1:19\",\"name\":\"01_Splash\",\"characters\":\"01_Splash\",\"parent\":\"01_Splash\"},{\"id\":\"1:20\",\"name\":\"Goal: Recognise the brand while the app loads.\",\"characters\":\"Goal: Recognise the brand whil