e • Copy: “Checkout” · “Payment” • Main navigation: current tab Cart • Payment methods: VISA · PayPal · Maestro · Apple Pay, each “*********2109” · only one can be chosen · current: VISA • Summary: Order ₹7,000 · Shipping ₹30 · Total ₹7,030\",\"characters\":\"• Actions: back · Continue\\n• Copy: “Checkout” · “Payment”\\n• Main navigation: current tab Cart\\n• Payment methods: VISA · PayPal · Maestro · Apple Pay, each “*********2109” · only one can be chosen · current: VISA\\n• Summary: Order ₹7,000 · Shipping ₹30 · Total ₹7,030\",\"parent\":\"13_Payment\"},{\"id\":\"1:107\",\"name\":\"LINKS\",\"characters\":\"LINKS\",\"parent\":\"13_Payment\"},{\"id\":\"1:108\",\"name\":\"→ back → 12_Shopping_Bag → Continue → 14_Payment_Success_Overlay → tabs\",\"characters\":\"→ back → 12_Shopping_Bag\\n→ Continue → 14_Payment_Success_Overlay\\n→ tabs\",\"parent\":\"13_Payment\"},{\"id\":\"1:110\",\"name\":\"14_Payment_Success_Overlay\",\"characters\":\"14_Payment_Success_Overlay\",\"parent\":\"14_Payment_Success_Overlay\"},{\"id\":\"1:111\",\"name\":\"Goal: Know the payment went through.\",\"characters\":\"Goal: Know the payment went through.\",\"parent\":\"14_Payment_Success_Overlay\"},{\"id\":\"1:112\",\"name\":\"MUST INCLUDE\",\"characters\":\"MUST INCLUDE\",\"parent\":\"14_Payment_Success_Overlay\"},{\"id\":\"1:113\",\"name\":\"• Copy: “Payment done successfully.” • Presentation: dialog over 13_Payment; Payment stays behind it • Status: success mark\",\"characters\":\"• Copy: “Payment done successfully.”\\n• Presentation: dialog over 13_Payment; Payment stays behind it\\n• Status: success mark\",\"parent\":\"14_Payment_Success_Overlay\"},{\"id\":\"1:114\",\"name\":\"LINKS\",\"characters\":\"LINKS\",\"parent\":\"14_Payment_Success_Overlay\"},{\"id\":\"1:115\",\"name\":\"→ tap dialog → 09_Home\",\"characters\":\"→ tap dialog → 09_Home\",\"parent\":\"14_Payment_Success_Overlay\"},{\"id\":\"1:117\",\"name\":\"15_Profile\",\"characters\":\"15_Profile\",\"parent\":\"15_Profile\"},{\