r, voice input, Shop Now, View all on Deal of the Day / New Arrivals, Visit now, Buy Now, View Similar, Add to Compare, Apply Coupons, Know More, EMI Details, Change Password, Save, social sign-in. • Do not add frames beyond the 15.\",\"characters\":\"• Onboarding: 01 → 02 → 03 → 04 → 05_Sign_In; Skip on 02–04 goes straight to 05.\\n• Account: 05_Sign_In ↔ 06_Sign_Up; 05 → 07_Forgot_Password → 05. Login / Create Account → 08_Get_Started → 09_Home.\\n• Main navigation on 09, 10, 11, 13 — five tabs in this order: Home (Icon_Home) → 09 · Wishlist (Icon_Wishlist, entry only) · Cart (Icon_Cart) → 12_Shopping_Bag · Search (Icon_Search, entry only) · Setting (Icon_Settings) → 15_Profile. The current tab must match the frame. How it looks is yours.\\n• Purchase: 09 → 11_Product_Detail → 12_Shopping_Bag → 13_Payment → 14 (dialog over 13) → 09.\\n• Entry only (no screen required): menu, Sort, Filter, voice input, Shop Now, View all on Deal of the Day / New Arrivals, Visit now, Buy Now, View Similar, Add to Compare, Apply Coupons, Know More, EMI Details, Change Password, Save, social sign-in.\\n• Do not add frames beyond the 15.\",\"parent\":\"Navigation structure\"},{\"id\":\"1:127\",\"name\":\"Fixed data & copy\",\"characters\":\"Fixed data & copy\",\"parent\":\"Fixed data & copy\"},{\"id\":\"1:128\",\"name\":\"Use these values verbatim. Counts use Indian digit grouping (1,52,344). “was” = original price shown struck through or otherwise marked as former price — how is yours.\",\"characters\":\"Use these values verbatim. Counts use Indian digit grouping (1,52,344). “was” = original price shown struck through or otherwise marked as former price — how is yours.\",\"parent\":\"Fixed data & copy\"},{\"id\":\"1:131\",\"name\":\"User & account\",\"characters\":\"User & account\",\"parent\":\"User & account\"},{\"id\":\"1:132\",\"name\":\"Aashifa · aashifa@gmail.com · password masked · avatar = Avatar_Illustrated Sign in / Sign up fields: “Username or Email”, “Password”, “Confirm P