:\"• Frame list and exact names\\n• Must-include content per frame (what, not how)\\n• Navigation structure and links\\n• All data and copy\\n• Brand primary color + Montserrat\\n• Media: logo, product photos, banners, payment logos, icons, illustrated avatar\\n• Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\",\"parent\":\"Fixed (given)\"},{\"id\":\"1:170\",\"name\":\"Yours (designer decides)\",\"characters\":\"Yours (designer decides)\",\"parent\":\"Yours (designer decides)\"},{\"id\":\"1:171\",\"name\":\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, semantic, sale and rating colors • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: selected, pressed, disabled, focused, current slide / step • Headers, main navigation, product cards, dialogs and all business components • How prices, discounts and ratings are shown\",\"characters\":\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen\\n• All other colors: neutrals, text, surfaces, semantic, sale and rating colors\\n• Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation\\n• All states: selected, pressed, disabled, focused, current slide / step\\n• Headers, main navigation, product cards, dialogs and all business components\\n• How prices, discounts and ratings are shown\",\"parent\":\"Yours (designer decides)\"},{\"id\":\"1:173\",\"name\":\"How it is evaluated\",\"characters\":\"How it is evaluated\",\"parent\":\"How it is evaluated\"},{\"id\":\"1:174\",\"name\":\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\",\"characters\":\"Your file is compared with the brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any reference.\",\"parent\":\"How it is evaluated\"},{\"id\":\"1:175\",\"name\":\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data & copy accuracy 3. Flow & prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality & consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current tab, size, slide, step and payment method; empty forms)\",\"characters\":\"1. Checklist coverage per frame\\n2. Data & copy accuracy\\n3. Flow & prototype completeness\\n4. Information hierarchy\\n5. Visual quality & consistency of your own system\\n6. Component reuse\\n7. State design (current tab, size, slide, step and payment method; empty forms)\",\"parent\":\"How it is evaluated\"},{\"id\":\"1:176\",\"name\":\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 15 named frames, your components and the prototype.\",\"characters\":\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 15 named frames, your components and the prototype.\",\"parent\":\"How it is evaluated\"}],\"foundationsTexts\":[{\"id\":\"2:3\",\"name\":\"Foundations · Stylish\",\"characters\":\"Foundations · Stylish\",\"parent\":\"Foundations\"},{\"id\":\"2:4\",\"name\":\"Fixed: the brand primary color and the typeface below — they carry the Stylish identity. Everything else is yours to define and apply consistently: neutrals and grays, text colors, surfaces and backgrounds, semantic colors (success, error, warning, disabled), sale / discount and rating colors, type scale, weights per role, spacing, radii and elevation.\",\"characters\":\"Fixed: the brand primary color and the typeface below — they carry the Stylish identity. Everything else is yours to define and apply consistently: neutrals and grays, text colors, surfaces and backgrounds, semantic colors (success, error, warning, disabled), sale / discount and rating colors, type scale, weights per role, spacing, radii and elevation.\",\"parent\":\"Foundations\"},{\"id\":\"2:6\",\"name\":\"Brand color\",\"characters\":\"Brand color\",\"parent\":\"Brand color\"},{\"id\":\"2:9\",\"name\":\"Brand primary\",\"characters\":\"Brand primary\",\"parent\":\"Brand primary\"},{\"id\":\"2:10\",\"name\":\"#F83758\",\"characters\":\"#F83758\",\"parent\":\"Brand primary\"},{\"id\":\"2:11\",\"name\":\"The Stylish brand color. Where and how much to use it is your decision.\",\"characters\":\"The Stylish brand color. Where and how much to use it is your decision.\",\"parent\":\"Brand primary\"},{\"id\":\"2:13\",\"name\":\"Typeface\",\"characters\":\"Typeface\",\"parent\":\"Typeface\"},{\"id\":\"2:14\",\"name\":\"Montserrat\",\"characters\":\"Montserrat\",\"parent\":\"Typeface\"},{\"id\":\"2:15\",\"name\":\"Aa Bb Cc 0123456789 ₹1,500 50% Off\",\"characters\":\"Aa Bb Cc 0123456789  ₹1,500  50% Off\",\"parent\":\"Typeface\"},{\"id\":\"2:16\",\"name\":\"Use Montserrat for all UI text (Regular / Medium / SemiBold / Bold available). The Stylish logo is supplied as artwork in 04 · Media — do not retype it.\",\"characters\":\"Use Montserrat for all UI text (Regular / Medium / SemiBold / Bold available). The Stylish logo is supplied as artwork in 04 · Media — do not retype it.\",\"parent\":\"Typeface\"},{\"id\":\"2:17\",\"name\":\"Canvas: 375 × 812 (iPhone). Light mode only.\",\"characters\":\"Canvas: 375 × 812 (iPhone). Light mode only.\",\"parent\":\"Foundations\"}]}"}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"84920b44-5db4-400f-8dc2-4b5d04561879"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_648f9e2a0ecd4ee69e9a9b27f0d0beee","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202611030703028668149088268d9d6l0iP6tTG","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_82feb4883817464cbcfcbd877c2b8d06","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"async function inspectComponentsAndMedia() {\n  const componentsPage = figma.root.children.find(p => p.name.includes('02 · Components'));\n  const mediaPage = figma.root.children.find(p => p.name.includes('04 · Media'));\n\n  let components = [];\n  if (componentsPage) {\n    await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(componentsPage);\n    components = componentsPage.findAll().map(n => ({\n      id: n.id,\n      name: n.name,\n      type: n.type\n    }));\n  }\n\n  let media = [];\n  if (mediaPage) {\n    await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(mediaPage);\n    media = mediaPage.findAll(n => n.parent && n.parent.name === 'Media' || n.type === 'COMPONENT' || n.type === 'FRAME' || n.type === 'GROUP' || n.type === 'INSTANCE').map(n => ({\n      id: n.id,\n      name: n.name,\n      type: n.type,\n      parent: n.parent ? n.parent.name : null\n    }));\n  }\n\n  return { components, media };\n}\n\nreturn await inspectComponentsAndMedia();\n","description":"Inspect components and media items in 02 · Components and 04 · Media","fileKey":"IAG5T5xfRayj74SLktrsW5"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":24046,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":10791},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e2bed913-5c8b-48ac-b9f1-c427778f4691","uuid":"648f9a45-ead6-44da-b3b2-c0a9a9128150","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:03:08.163Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_82feb4883817464cbcfcbd877c2b8d06","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
